            <title>GlideRail 2.1.13</title>
            <pubDate>Tue, 27 Oct 2026 04:42:35 +0000</pubDate>
            <sparkle:version>2.1.13</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>2.1.13</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description><![CDATA[
                <ul>
                    <li>The sidebar, Cue Mode, Settings and the toolbar menus open and close faster and more smoothly</li>
                    <li>New buttons throughout, and Invisible, Click-through and Voice Scroll light up in their own color when on</li>
                    <li>Invisible, Click-through and Live Rail respond the moment you click them, and Voice Scroll starts again much faster</li>
                    <li>The sidebar's scroll bar stays thin and hides when you're not scrolling</li>
                    <li>Fixed a crash when Voice Scroll's "no audio" tip appeared</li>                </ul>
            ]]></description>
